==Weaknesses==
<gallery type="slideshow">
MHR (434).png|Exploitable Speed
Christmas (514).png|Slippery Surfaces
K10 (107).png|Sticky Surfaces
MW (637).png|Electricity Vulnerability
</gallery>
XLR8's biggest weakness is magnets and charged pulses, as they can completely throw him off-course and cause him to lose his footing and spin out of control.{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = Bandai}}

Opponents with good reflexes and reaction time can counter XLR8's speed and land a blow on him, such as [[Transylian]]s,<ref name="TR" /> [[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramands]],<ref name="MHR" /> and [[Vulpimancer (Classic)|Vulpimancers]].<ref>''[[And Then There Was Ben]]''</ref>

XLR8's speed does not work on all surfaces: running on ice will make him lose his balance, causing him to slip and slide around;<ref name="MC" /> whereas running on sticky surfaces, such as [[Sploot|Sploot's]] goo, leaves him stuck in place.<ref name="Ken 10" />

XLR8 is vulnerable to electricity.<ref name="MW" />

==History==
===1773===   
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', 16-year-old Ben as XLR8 was defeated by young [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]].

===Ben 10===
*XLR8 first appeared in ''[[And Then There Were 10]]'', where he got revenge on [[JT (Classic)|JT]] and [[Cash Murray (Classic)|Cash]] before helping [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] and [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] pack their belongings into the [[Rustbucket (Classic)|Rustbucket]].
* In ''[[The Krakken]]'', XLR8 saved some people from the [[Krakken]], but failed to stop her from stealing a crate from [[Jonah Melville|Jonah's]] boat.
*In ''[[Permanent Retirement]]'', XLR8 was used offscreen to take the people back to their houses.
*In ''[[Kevin 11 (Episode)|Kevin 11]]'', XLR8 saved [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] from some bullies.
*In ''[[The Alliance]]'', XLR8 battled [[Rojo]] until he was forced to retreat with Gwen.
*In ''[[Lucky Girl (Episode)|Lucky Girl]]'', XLR8 defeated [[Hex (Classic)|Hex]] in a museum.
*In ''[[Secrets]]'', XLR8 appeared while he was captured. Later, XLR8 fought [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] on [[Mt. Rushmore (Classic)|Mt. Rushmore]] until the malfunctioning [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] made him switch into [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]].  
**Also, XLR8 appeared as one of the many alien templates used for Vilgax's army in an imaginary sequence.
*In ''[[Truth]]'', XLR8 traveled to the Mt. Rushmore [[Plumbers (Classic)|Plumber]] base with Gwen and was defeated by a [[Wigzellian Orc Beast]].
*In ''[[The Big Tick]]'', XLR8 failed to defeat the [[Great One]].
*In ''[[The Galactic Enforcers]]'', XLR8 battled [[SixSix (Classic)|SixSix]] and [[Vulkanus]].
*In ''[[Camp Fear]]'', XLR8 searched the underground level of [[Camp Opinicon]] for Max and found him, but reverted before he could free him.
*In ''[[Back With a Vengeance]]'', XLR8 appeared six times. Firstly, XLR8 was used by the Master Control. Later, he stole Max's food. Then, he ran on the river in order to catch a falling cart. After that, XLR8 went after Vilgax and [[Kevin 11]]. Lastly, in the [[Null Void (Classic)|Null Void]], XLR8 tried to escape from Vilgax twice.
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]'', XLR8 saved Gwen from her [[Dr. Gwendolyn Tennyson|future self]] and later fought [[Exo-Skull|Exo-Skull]] until he reverted.
*In ''[[Merry Christmas]]'', XLR8 defeated some toy Nutcracker soldiers.
*In ''[[Under Wraps]]'', XLR8 defeated a pair of [[Corrodium|mutated]] cows and battled the [[Mummy]] until he reverted. Later, XLR8 collected some chicken eggs.
*In ''[[Monster Weather]]'', XLR8 played the drums in a band and protected some people from [[S.A.M.|S.A.M.'s]] lightning. He then chased the latter through the city and eventually defeated him.
*In ''[[The Unnaturals]]'', XLR8 intervened with the [[Squires]] to help the Cannons win the baseball game and humiliated JT and Cash in the process. Later, XLR8 hung JT and Cash from a sign by their shirts.
*In ''[[The Return]]'', XLR8 fought [[Dr. Viktor]] and witnessed [[Zs'Skayr]] being revived.
*In ''[[Perfect Day]]'', XLR8 defeated [[Sir Enoch]] and some [[Forever Knights]] and trapped the former in a dream world. In Enoch's dream, XLR8 failed to trap him in a dream world and quickly reverted.
*In the Blue Edition of '''''[[Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix]]''''', XLR8 fought a [[Mutant Wasp]] and destroyed [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo's]] [[Devolution Bomb|DNA bomb]], accidentally activating the Omnitrix's Self-Destruct Mode in the process.
*In ''[[Ben 4 Good Buddy]]'', XLR8 fixed the [[Rustbucket (Classic)|Rustbucket]].
*In ''[[Ready to Rumble]]'', XLR8 road down a hill while sitting on an ice block.
*In ''[[Ben 10 vs. Negative 10: Part 1]]'', XLR8 battled some [[Sublimino|hypnotized]] guards.
*In ''[[Let the Games Begin]]'', XLR8 looked for certain objects on the road so he could beat Gwen in a game of bingo.

===Five Years Prior to Omniverse===
*In ''[[Trouble Helix]]'', [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was stuck as XLR8 until [[Azmuth (Classic)|Azmuth]] reverted him.
*In ''[[Malefactor]]'', XLR8 fought [[Malware]].
*In ''[[Ben Again]]'', XLR8 battled [[Eon]].
*In ''[[Bengeance is Mine]]'', XLR8 tried to fight [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]], but got captured by a [[Squid Monster]].
*In ''[[The Vengers]]'', XLR8 saved some people from a burning skyscraper and captured [[Kane North|Kangaroo Kommando]].
*In ''[[Weapon XI: Part 2]]'', XLR8 tried to run from [[Weapon XI (Flashback)|Mutant Kevin]], but was trapped by his vines.

===Alien Force=== 
*XLR8 was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.

===Ultimate Alien=== 
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', XLR8 was re-unlocked by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]].
*In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Ben 10/Generator Rex: Heroes United]]'', XLR8 saved [[Dr. Rebecca Holiday|Dr. Holiday]] from [[Alpha]].
**Also, XLR8 appeared as one of the many aliens when [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] was explaining his story to [[Rex Salazar (Generator Rex)|Rex]].

===Omniverse=== 
*In ''[[Hot Stretch]]'', XLR8 won a game of street hockey with Ester and the [[Kineceleran (Classic)|Kineceleran]] kids.
*In ''[[Many Happy Returns]]'', XLR8 and [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] were defeated by [[Looma Red Wind|Princess Looma]].
*In ''[[Rules of Engagement]]'', XLR8 defeated [[Fistina]].
*In ''[[Store 23]]'', XLR8 was about to fight [[Dimension 23|Dimension 23's]] [[Tetrax Shard (Dimension 23)|Tetrax]] before the latter teleported. Later, XLR8 saved [[Ben 23]] from [[SevenSeven (Dimension 23)|SevenSeven 23's]] bomb.
*In ''[[The Frogs of War: Part 1]]'', XLR8 ran from [[Milleous]] and prepared to attack him before reverting.
*In ''[[The Frogs of War: Part 2]]'', XLR8 knocked over a [[Way Bad]].
*In ''[[Mud is Thicker Than Water]]'', XLR8 fought [[Psyphon's Gang|Psyphon's thugs]].
*In ''[[And Then There Was Ben]]'', [[Gwen 10 (Gweniverse)|Gwen 10]] as XLR8 was defeated by [[Ben Tennyson (No Watch Timeline)|No Watch Ben]] as [[Wildmutt]].
*In ''[[Collect This]]'', XLR8 tried to find clean shirts of his as a kid so he could give one to [[Collectimus]].
*In ''[[The Ballad of Mr. Baumann]]'', XLR8 took [[Ignacius Baumann|Mr. Baumann]] back to his store.
*In ''[[Vreedlemania]]'', XLR8 ran through a street to search for [[Ma Vreedle]].
*In ''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]'', XLR8 ran off in anger before discovering the path to the [[Temple of the Sky]] and showing it to [[Kai Green|Kai]].
*In ''[[Third Time's a Charm]]'', XLR8 tried to read through the books in [[Hex (Classic)|Hex's]] library, but quickly became bored.
*In ''[[A New Dawn]]'', XLR8 fought Vilgax, but the Omnitrix prepared to revert him, and he was defeated. Later, XLR8 appeared for a short time when Ben was cycling through his aliens.

===[[Original Future Timeline]]===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 (Episode)|Ben 10,000]]'', XLR8 appeared thrice. Firstly, he defeated [[Exo-Skull|Exo-Skull]]. Later, he brought Ben and Gwen back to his headquarters. Then, he was defeated by [[Vilgax (Original Future)|Vilgax]], forcing him to switch into [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]].
*In ''[[Ken 10]]'', XLR8 appeared six times. Firstly, [[Ben 10,000 (Original)|Ben 10,000]] as XLR8 ran home to be on time to [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken's]] birthday party. Later, both Ben and Ken's XLR8s left home to stop [[Sploot]] only for Ken to get stuck to the floor. Afterward, Ben as XLR8 failed to imprison [[Devlin Levin|Devlin]] with a Null Void egg. The next day, Ben as XLR8 fought Devlin again. Lastly, Ken as XLR8 was defeated by [[Kevin 11,000]].

===[[Ultimate Alien Future Timeline]]===  
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', [[Ultimate Ben]] used XLR8's enhanced speed twice.

===Gwen 10 (What-If?)===
*In ''[[Gwen 10 (Episode)|Gwen 10]]'', [[Gwen Tennyson (Gwen 10)|Gwen]] used XLR8 off-screen to pick up some clothes she forgot to bring from home.

===Goodbye and Good Riddance (What-If?)===
*In ''[[Goodbye and Good Riddance]]'', XLR8 cleaned his room. Later, XLR8 lured Vilgax underground in the sewers and escaped with [[Carl Tennyson (Goodbye and Good Riddance)|Carl]] before the igniting gas valve would go off.

